{
 "title": "GTA 6 Made $3.79 Billion on Day One",
 "src": "../gta6_story/scenes_long",
 "hook": [
  "$3.79 BILLION",
  "IN ONE DAY"
 ],
 "top_title": "WAS GTA 6 WORTH THE WAIT?",
 "segments": [
  {
   "text": "GTA Six made three point seven nine billion dollars. On day one.",
   "imgs": [
    "g072_c.png"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "After thirteen years, two delays, and a massive leak.",
   "imgs": [
    "g064_c.png",
    "g066_b.png"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Rockstar never revealed the budget. Estimates range from one to two billion dollars.",
   "imgs": [
    "g070_a.png",
    "g070_d.png"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "But before launch, it had already sold thirty-two and a half million copies.",
   "imgs": [
    "g071_d.png",
    "g071_b.png"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Then day one hit.",
   "imgs": [
    "g072_b.png"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "That's more than Avengers: Endgame made in its entire run in theaters.",
   "imgs": [
    "g073_a.png",
    "g073_c.png"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "And nearly five times what GTA Five made on its first day.",
   "imgs": [
    "g074_c.png",
    "g074_a.png"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Rockstar bet that people would wait. They were right.",
   "imgs": [
    "g075_a.png",
    "g076_b.png"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Worth thirteen years? Tell me in the comments.",
   "imgs": [
    "g076_a.png"
   ]
  }
 ],
